<!--
    Silvanus onboarding header.

    A single solid teal panel whose bottom edge is a soft, low-amplitude
    wave (~13dp peak-to-trough): it sits high across the left third, slides
    down through the middle, runs low across the right, then lifts again at
    the right edge.

    Traced from the design mockup. The 360 x 208 viewport must stay in sync
    with @dimen/header_teal_height or the wave will stretch.
-->
